Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.10.103-rt114 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.10.103 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.10-rt
  Head SHA1: 8cea6a134068e9a9f1bd0fe03ae3988b28d38e8a


Or to build 3.10.103-rt114 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.10.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.10.103.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.10/patch-3.10.103-rt114.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve
